INSAPOS v2.2d: Fix content cutoff on small screens, transparent logo

- Payment panel: scrollable content with pinned "Complete Sale" button
- Cart panel: pinned footer so "Pay & Complete" never gets cut off
- Order review: pinned summary bar with flex-shrink-0
- Payment methods: 3-column grid on small screens (was 2)
- Shift bar: compact spacing with truncation on small screens
- Modals: max-height with overflow-y-auto for small viewports
- Body: dynamic viewport height (100dvh) for Android WebView
- Safe area padding for system bars
- Regenerated all app icons with transparent background
- Bumped to v2.2d (versionCode 4), updated GHA artifact names
